			"notes": "We are back with one of the most requested versions - 1.21(.1) is here with a new mod update alongside of it!\n\n![image](https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/334976/changelog/changelog_cfb3a863-9edb-4b55-b492-ad0b1cf7dab0.png)\n\n3.2 introduces:\n- A new HUD bar showing the remaining blocking time for mod items (the same texture is used from Asgard Shield!)\n- The Stone and Gilded Stone shields now will extinguish the player when blocking an attack while on fire (50% chance and 100% chance respectively)\n- A JEI plugin is built-in to show repair recipes for the mod items\n- Bug fixes\n\nThanks for waiting patiently for this version of AS:R. I'm hoping to bring this version over to 26.x soon. Until next time, feel free to send any issues over to the [issue tracker](https://github.com/ManGregory128/asgardshieldreloaded/issues)."
		},
