			"notes": "New update? So soon? Whaaaaaat?\n![image](https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/334976/changelog/changelog_6a21bf9f-086b-402b-8d8a-e0ef1d35984f.png)\n\n3.1 is out for 26.2 and 26.1.2 and for both Fabric and NeoForge. It brings:\n- Copper Giant Sword, Shield and Gilded Shield\n- Netherite Giant Sword, Shield and Gilded Shield\n- New functionality for the new shields (no spoilers, see in-game!)\n- Shields can now be enchanted with Mending, Unbreaking & Curse of Vanishing\n- Bug fixes (for example, shields can now be equipped quickly on the off-hand within the inventory, just like the vanilla shield)\n\nThank you for still playing with Asgard Shield: Reloaded. It means so much! If you want to contribute to updating the mod on other versions of the game, please don't hesitate to reach out. Help is always welcome!"
		},
